{
  "case_id": "SELECTOR-PRISM-FUNC-CONFIRM-26.1.2",
  "title": "26.1.2 目标选择器功能验证 · 补测 ① 左键确认（confirm）路径",
  "version": "26.1.2",
  "target": {
    "type": "existing-feature",
    "ref": "mc-26.1.2-target-selector-w1"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "【为什么补这一条】`SELECTOR-PRISM-FUNC-26.1.2` 实测 46/48 PASS，唯一两条 FAIL 是 `key=left action=confirm` 与 `confirm sent token=`：回看 `func-debug.log` L3439 为 `confirm ignored: no valid target (token=1272878529)` —— 原因是补测阶段把僵尸召唤在 `~1 ~ ~4`（**偏离准星**），而 `mt_inject` **不能移动视角**，故准星没命中僵尸、`currentTarget` 为 null。第一段用 `~ ~ ~4`（正前方）时是**命中过的**（同文件 L3398 `target=2178(僵尸) hostile=true friendly=false`）。本用例只用「正前方召唤」重跑该路径。\n\n【环境】沿用同一客户端（光影关 + ImmediatelyFast 停用，最终构建 `Fix 1 + entitySolid`）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astral_dice targetselect enemy",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/summon minecraft:zombie ~ ~ ~4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_mouse",
      "button": "left",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2000
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "debug",
      "pattern": "TargetSelectionClient\\] start token="
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "debug",
      "pattern": "TargetSelectionClient\\] target=\\d+\\(.*\\) hostile=true"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "debug",
      "pattern": "TargetSelectPrompt\\] key=left action=confirm"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "debug",
      "pattern": "TargetSelectionClient\\] confirm sent token="
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "Missing sampler|Unreported exception thrown"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ],
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running"
}
